@host = http://localhost:5069
@pot = 1

### Latest weight of the pot (normal or session reading)
GET {{host}}/api/weight/latest?pot={{pot}}
Accept: application/json

### ===== User calibration session (docs/pipeline/calibration-session.md) =====
### Run these in order. Each answers with the calibration state; a refused step answers
### 409 Conflict with a "message" saying why.

### 0. Current calibration (+ session in progress, if any)
GET {{host}}/api/calibration/{{pot}}
Accept: application/json

### 1. Start: sends calibration_start. The robot counts down 30 s (lift the pot off!),
###    tares, then streams a reading every ~4 s. Poll step 0 until phase = awaiting_dry.
POST {{host}}/api/calibration/{{pot}}/start

### 2. Place the dry pot, hands off, wait ~5 s, then save the dry point.
POST {{host}}/api/calibration/{{pot}}/dry

### 3. Water as you normally do, then press "Done watering" (starts the drain timer).
POST {{host}}/api/calibration/{{pot}}/watered

### 4. After CALIBRATION_DRAIN_MINUTES (30 by default), save the wet point. Ends the session.
POST {{host}}/api/calibration/{{pot}}/wet

### Abandon the session at any step (the previous calibration is kept)
POST {{host}}/api/calibration/{{pot}}/cancel
